    "logs": "67.0 APEX_CODE,DEBUG;APEX_PROFILING,INFO\nExecute Anonymous: // O3 backfill: stamp pre-O3 Twilio texts from the last 90 days. NOT RUN. Run only after the deploy.\nExecute Anonymous: // The O3 fields have no FLS for anyone (reads are system-mode Apex), so this script must not name them in static SOQL.\nExecute Anonymous: // Rows whose Lead lookup points at a converted lead cannot be saved (INSUFFICIENT_ACCESS_ON_CROSS_REFERENCE_ENTITY); they are skipped and counted.\nExecute Anonymous: // The before-update trigger (ExternalLoStampTwilioMessage -> LoWsTextsService.stamp) does the work, so this\nExecute Anonymous: // just touches the rows: outbound first, then inbound (replies thread on the outbound phone keys).\nExecute Anonymous: // Run 9 times, oldest window first, editing START_DAYS_AGO each time: 90, 80, 70, ... 10.\nExecute Anonymous: //   sf apex run -o Production -f backfill-90d.apex\nExecute Anonymous: // ~60 texts/day, so a 10-day window is ~600 rows: well inside one transaction's limits.\nExecute Anonymous: // Side effects checked 2026-10-09: EDGE_Twilio_Message_Relate_To_Transaction only re-fires when Twilio's own\nExecute Anonymous: // lookup/number/parent/direction fields change (they do not here); the reply-alert and owner flows are create-only.\nExecute Anonymous: Integer START_DAYS_AGO = 90;\nExecute Anonymous: Datetime fromAt = Datetime.now().addDays(-START_DAYS_AGO);\nExecute Anonymous: Datetime toAt = fromAt.addDays(10);\nExecute Anonymous: \nExecute Anonymous: List<TwilioSF__Message__c> outbound = [\nExecute Anonymous:     SELECT Id FROM TwilioSF__Message__c\nExecute Anonymous:     WHERE CreatedDate >= :fromAt AND CreatedDate < :toAt\nExecute Anonymous:       AND TwilioSF__Direction__c != 'inbound' AND TwilioSF__To_Number__c != null\nExecute Anonymous:     ORDER BY CreatedDate\nExecute Anonymous: ];\nExecute Anonymous: Integer outFail = 0; for (Database.SaveResult r : Database.update(outbound, false)) { if (!r.isSuccess()) outFail++; }\nExecute Anonymous: List<TwilioSF__Message__c> inbound = [\nExecute Anonymous:     SELECT Id FROM TwilioSF__Message__c\nExecute Anonymous:     WHERE CreatedDate >= :fromAt AND CreatedDate < :toAt\nExecute Anonymous:       AND TwilioSF__Direction__c = 'inbound' AND TwilioSF__From_Number__c != null\nExecute Anonymous:     ORDER BY CreatedDate\nExecute Anonymous: ];\nExecute Anonymous: Integer inFail = 0; for (Database.SaveResult r : Database.update(inbound, false)) { if (!r.isSuccess()) inFail++; }\nExecute Anonymous: System.debug(LoggingLevel.ERROR, 'O3 backfill ' + fromAt.date() + ' to ' + toAt.date() + ': outbound ' + outbound.size()\nExecute Anonymous:     + ' (skipped ' + outFail + '), inbound ' + inbound.size() + ' (skipped ' + inFail + '), now stamped to a Workspace LO: '\nExecute Anonymous:     + Database.countQuery('SELECT COUNT() FROM TwilioSF__Message__c WHERE CreatedDate >= :fromAt AND CreatedDate < :toAt AND External_LO__c != null'));\n13:08:48.78 (78520792)|USER_INFO|[EXTERNAL]|005f2000009OtLn|clowman@reachhomeloans.com|(GMT-04:00) Eastern Daylight Time (America/New_York)|GMT-04:00\n13:08:48.78 (78595023)|EXECUTION_STARTED\n13:08:48.78 (78648154)|CODE_UNIT_STARTED|[EXTERNAL]|execute_anonymous_apex\n13:08:48.78 (215108001)|CODE_UNIT_STARTED|[EXTERNAL]|Flow:01I5x000001Jfs0\n13:08:48.78 (215177292)|CODE_UNIT_FINISHED|Flow:01I5x000001Jfs0\n13:08:48.553 (553281993)|CUMULATIVE_LIMIT_USAGE\n13:08:48.553 (553281993)|LIMIT_USAGE_FOR_NS|(default)|\n  Number of SOQL queries: 1 out of 100\n  Number of query rows: 645 out of 50000\n  Number of SOSL queries: 0 out of 20\n  Number of DML statements: 1 out of 150\n  Number of Publish Immediate DML: 0 out of 150\n  Number of DML rows: 645 out of 10000\n  Maximum CPU time: 92 out of 10000\n  Maximum heap size: 0 out of 6000000\n  Number of callouts: 0 out of 100\n  Number of Email Invocations: 0 out of 10\n  Number of future calls: 0 out of 50\n  Number of queueable jobs added to the queue: 0 out of 50\n  Number of Mobil